  "text": "[calm] Before this film was allowed to exist — this one, the one you are watching — it had to pass a test. Six checks, green or red. Every room loaded. Every voice ready to play. [short pause] One red row, and the film refuses to be filmed. [pause] The test exists because none of these films was stitched together in an editor. Each one is a live web page, playing itself, in one unbroken take. The pages are still up. Walk in at any room's own door, and drive it by hand. [short pause] This film is built from the same machinery it describes. So it can demonstrate itself.",
